cues.rawText:
Bartender, I'm looking
for that no-good,
cheating blacksmith.

We'll stop it here,
uncouple the cars
from the tender,

Emmett, when
my bags were thrown
from the wagon,

selling to you tonight
for the low,
low price of $12.

But if Buford Tannen
comes looking
for trouble,

After all,
I had to come back
for Einstein,
